WEBVTT

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.720
Yay, I won!

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.610
I get a whole year's worth of shakes!

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:24.530
That shot just then was out.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.350
Why?

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.300
Why did you come here?

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.500
You, too. What on Earth are you doing here?

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.620
Your mother's very worried about you.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.110
You should go home quickly and properly apologize to her-

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:48.020
Mana-chan!

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:50.890
Asagiridai.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:54.400
Hey, wait!

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.970
Looks like she gave you the cold shoulder.

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:11.470
nemuri nasai ima wa tada

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:11.470
Sleep, for now

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:18.380
watashi no naka de doko ni mo ikanai de

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:18.380
Inside of me, and don't go anywhere

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:39.390
madoromi no fuchi de yureteru gunjou iro no yo

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:39.390
Through the slumbering ultramarine sky

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:44.910
majiwaru koto no nai hoshi wo sagashiteru

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:44.910
I am searching for stars that will never cross

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:52.610
anata wo motomeru yubisaki yami ni samayotte

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:52.610
These fingertips search for you, but are lost in darkness

00:01:52.940 --> 00:02:01.490
mogaite mo nukedesenai ai no umi ni oboreteku

00:01:52.940 --> 00:02:01.490
I try but I can't escape, and I drown in the sea of love

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:09.380
yawaranai toiki ni kokoro sae mo furueru

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:09.380
Your tender sigh makes my heart tremble

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:15.000
karamaru utsukushi kumo no ito no you

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:15.000
Seemingly entangled in the beautiful strands of a spider web

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:19.490
ugokenai no watashi wo yurushite

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:19.490
I cannot move, please forgive me

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:22.820
anata no ude ni dakarete nemuru

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:22.820
I am sleeping with your arms around me

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:26.040
nani mo kamo sutetatte ii

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:26.040
I don't mind losing anything else

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:33.570
ii kono mama no maboroshi nante zukuru no wa yamete

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:33.570
Stop pretending that you are a good girl

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:37.030
hontou no watashi wo mitsukete

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:37.030
Find the real me

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:43.110
zutto matteru

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:43.110
I'll be waiting forever

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:50.700
Why... do I have to see you?

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.380
There's something we have to settle.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.130
I'm not coming.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:55.320
There's no need for me to see you.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.220
It'll be strictly business; I won't do anything.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:02:59.390
Really.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.980
I can't do anything to you in a cafe inside the city, right?

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:18.510
Page 22
Troubled that you are a poor speaker?
Try conversing with your eyes,
you'll want to talk soon enough.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.900
Haruka, do you mind if I make a phone call?

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:27.450
Neither the phone nor any of the electrical appliances work.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.080
The taps are running, though.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.600
What about the public phones?

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:32.850
It'll take you an hour to walk there.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.570
I guess there's no helping it.

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.040
I'll get back using this, and return it to her while I'm at it.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:43.740
Touya, since you've come all the way here, how about taking it easy for a while?

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:52.060
In that case, I'll do just that.

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:53.720
Shall I be your partner?

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:55.690
I'm going for a run.

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:58.780
Hey now...

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:26.020
Why did you stop?

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:28.280
S-Sorry.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:41.070
By the way, I wrote that as a pop song.

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:43.220
I don't remember composing a modernist piece at all.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:46.220
Make sure you're not rearranging it.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:46.890
Yes.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:54.520
You weren't able to report it to the police?

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:58.460
I-I mean, it's not that I'm afraid of the police or anything.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:00.940
It's just that my dad's annoying.

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:03.120
There's no way I could've reported this to the police, is there?

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:06.910
To disgrace myself like that...

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:09.490
Is your belly fine now?

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:10.580
It's fine.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.610
So that porter of yours helped you out?

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:18.640
Who are you talking about?

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:23.300
Isn't that great! You have so many guys protecting you now.

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:26.110
You said it would be about business, so what is it?

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:28.740
I'd like you to write me an article.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.010
An article?

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:33.280
I'm a freelancer journalist right now.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:38.130
I just got hold of some information, and I want to report it.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:41.250
Why don't you just write it yourself?

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:45.150
You know how my literary skills are!

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.090
What's the information?

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:52.080
Your current porter's... you know, the guy from before...

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.740
Fujii-kun's not that kind of person.

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:57.200
That's right, that Fujii-kun.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.670
He's having an affair with Morikawa Yuki's manager.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.440
What... are you saying?

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:03.340
What about these?

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:10.500
That's... impossible.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:14.060
I mean, Fujii-kun and Yuki are-

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:18.850
Really. So he's Morikawa Yuki's boyfriend.

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:22.830
See, wouldn't it be easiest if you're the one who writes this!

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:27.180
Plus, this way, I won't have to write anything that'll inconvenience you...

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:27.990
Right?

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:29.410
I can't...

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:31.700
He's damn late.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.430
What the hell is that moron doing?

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:36.030
Ah, he's here.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.900
S-Sorry.

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:39.950
Did you show them to her?

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:42.460
Ah, yes. Here...

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:55.010
You gave her the negatives for money?!

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:55.920
You-!

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.660
Wasn't this what you meant by exchanging...

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:02.360
You fucking moron! Now we can't extort money from her!

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:04.610
O-Oww...

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:07.280
What are we going to do if she calls the police?!

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:10.940
O-Oww... please forgive me...

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:11.950
I understand.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:15.910
Ooh, it's good that you're level-headed, Misaki.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.820
I'll go back to how things were before.

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:19.650
Is that fine with you?

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:21.500
You'll go back? With who?

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:24.050
Back to two years ago.

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:26.620
So, please don't publish these photographs-

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:30.180
Hah! Two years ago? You can't be talking about...

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:33.140
That annoying girl who kept clinging to me,

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:36.330
who kept asking my dad for money and then ran off.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.440
You're talking about that bitch?

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:42.390
I never took any... money.

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.760
You actually still care about that?

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.440
You're amazing, amazing!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:51.450
You're not the type of girl who'd keep on clinging, you know.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:55.380
You're cheap. You're too cheap, Misaki!

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:59.400
That's right, it's too cheap.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.830
I have no idea what kind of magic you cast on her,

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:07.670
but a guy like you will never know when to stop, no matter how far you go.

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.130
Me... Me-chan.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:12.590
It's been a while, Kenichi-kun.

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:14.030
... "chan"?

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:18.020
I-I'm sorry it's... b-been a w-while.

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:20.770
W-What are... you d-doing h-here?

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:24.110
You'll disturb everyone around you if you keep shouting like that.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:27.260
I mean, isn't this supposed to be a secret meeting?

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:30.900
You have the attention of the entire cafe though.

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:38.030
They all heard it, it's out now.

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:42.450
Don't bother with such small information,

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:45.880
since I'll give you something big.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:58.540
This isn't what I meant.

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:07.670
Take your clothes off.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:09.060
Me too?

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:11.230
Take them off and sit beside me.

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:13.350
Huh, here?

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:15.870
It'll have more of an impact if there's a guy in it, right?

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:18.700
Your face won't be in the picture. Hurry up.

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:26.000
You there, be sure to take some good pictures.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:41.210
You're kidding, this is way too awesome!

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:43.310
You're talking about Me-chan?

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:47.140
That's right, that Me-chan actually went and did something like that.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:51.310
No, that's not really what I meant...

00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:52.810
You have enough for the article yet, Misaki?

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:54.260
Yeah.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.940
You'll only be writing about me.

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:58.930
You'll abandon any information about Touya-kun.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:00.200
Promise me.

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:02.550
I got it.

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:04.140
If it's your request, Me-chan, then I'll definitely-

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:07.580
Then I have nothing else to do with you. Hurry up and get out.

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:09.810
It's been a while now,

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.400
how about we go grab a bite or something?

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.500
I know this great Yakiniku restaurant...

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.950
My production company's probably looking around for me.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.970
It's probably about time for them to send a search request to the police.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.450
L-Let's go!

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:35.230
Are you a singer?

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:37.610
I guess I look it, though I'm not famous or anything.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:40.530
I'm sorry, I'm rather slow...

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.870
You know Tamaru-kun?

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.370
Yeah, from a while back.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.340
He went after me.

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:50.100
Are you fine with telling me this much?

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:51.840
I'm fine with it. What's wrong?

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:53.840
Maybe I should turn him down-

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.380
That's not a good idea.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.720
You should write it.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.720
Since it's no secret anymore,

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:02.810
even if you don't write it, someone else will, and they'll make it sound a lot worse.

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:04.970
Don't worry.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:09.460
All that information up until now was just bait to keep them in check.

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:12.050
I have other things I'd like to you to help me with.

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:14.680
Everything starts here. You'll help me?

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.010
But, I can't do anything...

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:19.250
Will I really be able to help?

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:23.340
We'll do this together, use the interview recorded in the tape.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:26.000
If you could use your intuition and dramatize things a bit,

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:29.230
so that it'll be emotionally moving, it would be great.

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:33.390
I'll be sure to pay you, and you have my word.

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:36.370
The name of the magazine will probably shock you though.

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:38.500
Will... you be fine?

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:41.220
I actually made the necessary arrangements with the editorial department,

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:42.830
so it's already all planned out.

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.850
That's why we don't have much time left.

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:48.070
I understand. Please let me do it.

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:49.390
Well then, let's have a toast.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:51.790
Can I ask you something?

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.070
We're starting already?

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:53.940
What?

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:56.240
Why are you doing this?

00:11:56.240 --> 00:12:01.950
Reason... it was you, wasn't it,
Sawakura-san? You were Touya-kun's...

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.030
I was his senior in high school.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:05.870
Umm... what about you?

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:09.900
I guess we were childhood friends, in a sense.

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:13.790
And, just like you, a savior-goddess.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:22.880
Now, let the true interview begin.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:51.990
Did you manage to contact President Kanzaki?

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:54.530
Looks like you've been having it hard at work.

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:58.440
I had work, so I wasn't able to go to the coming-of-age ceremony either.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:01.610
I dressed up though, so you can expect the photos in the next issue of...

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:05.380
Uh, I forgot the name of the magazine, but please look at it there.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:09.350
I'm in the middle of a lesson and the break is almost over,

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:12.050
so I'll stop here for today. Bye.

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:40.450
Was I imprudent? I know.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:43.170
But, I'm glad. Really.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.130
I'm glad.

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:08.800
Touya.

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:13.820
How're the preparations for dinner?

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:14.640
Uh...

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:23.600
Shall we go to a family restaurant?

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:33.600
The gas works...

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:52.300
Touya.

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:56.500
Ha- ... hey,

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.060
I'm a guy after all, you know.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.780
Really? Then let's do it.

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:04.700
What are you playing at?

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:06.300
Touya, let's do it.

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.380
As if I could!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:10.340
Wear something, you'll catch a cold!

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:15.110
Don't say things like my Onii-chan did.

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:20.370
That's right, I'm not your brother.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:21.490
Then who?

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:23.950
Who are you to me?

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:25.070
I'm not your anything!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.080
Where are you going?

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:32.570
I'm going back.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.040
I don't want you to go.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:40.830
I don't want to be alone anymore.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:44.040
Didn't I already tell you, that place is for-

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.600
Who's seat is it? Is it Mana-chan's?

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:47.250
Dummy.

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:49.590
It's not Yuki's seat,

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:50.720
because it's empty.

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:52.870
Haruka, let go.

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:53.750
Why?

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.970
Why do I have to let go?

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:56.640
Let go.

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:59.180
Even though you know...

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:01.340
Even though you knew a long time ago...

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:03.050
You pretend you don't know,

00:16:03.050 --> 00:16:05.970
You pretend to be my friend, pretend to be my brother,

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:07.740
you pretend not to be my anything...

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:09.690
Even though Yuki was the one who came in between us...

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:14.990
That's obviously not it at all.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.790
I'm not going back.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.670
I'm just going to clear my mind for a bit.

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:42.410
Ah, hello.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:45.580
Looks like he still isn't back yet.

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:47.260
I guess it was my fault...

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:49.300
I had a good reason...

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:51.130
He should be fine tomorrow.

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.800
He'll definitely come,

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:55.020
if he rides the bike and doesn't take the wrong path...

00:16:55.720 --> 00:16:57.060
Please accept this.

00:16:57.060 --> 00:16:58.770
Ah, please rest.

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:01.480
I'll leave quietly when the time is right...

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.550
Sorry about the late introduction,

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:06.920
but my name's Mizuki Mana,

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:10.550
and I'm... uh, Fujii-sensei's petty little student.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.630
Touya is...

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:13.700
Yes?

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:14.790
Did you say something?

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.570
with Haruka-chan again...

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:20.480
How did you know?

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:23.550
It's actually like this.

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:28.750
Well, it's not like I wasn't able to stop myself from getting so emotional...

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:31.400
But this whole thing all started...

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:34.740
when your son and my mother ganged up against me, and Haruka-

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.630
He's such a troublemaker.

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:39.660
Ah, no, it's fine, I'm not angry at him anymore...

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:44.580
He's always following Haruka-chan's back.

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:50.530
I don't really... think so, but...

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:52.470
Should I say this?

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:55.780
Do you know her? Your son's girlfriend-

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:57.930
Which of the two is the guy, I wonder.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:01.140
But you know, she's very kind.

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:05.080
Just like her dead mother.

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:08.070
Yuki-chan.

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:13.570
Touya should be back soon.

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:17.030
Feel free to wait for him here.

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:18.700
U-Umm...

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.350
What an irritating old man.

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:40.990
Touya.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:44.800
I'm sorry about just now.

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:45.870
Yeah.

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:47.430
Forget about it.

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.020
I wonder if I can.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:52.940
Are you turned on?

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:54.120
Like I would be.

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:05.290
Haruka.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:06.350
Yeah?

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:08.150
I'm sorry.

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:09.410
Huh?

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:12.200
I've also depended on you too much.

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:14.170
I took advantage of your kindness,

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:16.170
and used you whenever it was convenient for me.

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:19.840
It's okay, I don't mind.

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:22.010
As an apology...

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:28.000
You're stingy.

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:28.690
I'm not stingy.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.090
It's

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.090
like drinking water

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:51.380
It's

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:51.380
like breathing air

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:05.810
Since how many years ago

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:06.190
it's like it's always been this way

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:27.240
You made your way back!

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.150
There, there.

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:38.710
Sorry for disturbing you so early in the morning.

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:41.120
Have you left the apartment yet?

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:43.170
Or could it be you're still sleeping?

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:47.860
Yesterday- ... or should I say the day before yesterday,

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:49.260
President Kanzaki was worried,

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:53.130
but I called her back, and the matter's settled after all.

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:55.570
And um... thank you.

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:57.230
I think that's all I have to say.

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:02.400
I have to go to work now, too.

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:03.980
Bye.

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:12.220
I went to visit Fujii-sensei's father in the hospital. -Mana

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:18.840
Menou.

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:22.050
The album's finished.

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:28.340
Good morning.

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:31.790
I went to your apartment but it seemed like you'd already left.

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:35.830
I didn't intend to stay over at a friend's place yesterday,

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:37.830
but we kinda let loose and...

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:39.080
Sorry.

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.500
What should I do at times like this?

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:46.090
Should I be shouting?

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:49.160
Or should I be crying and wailing?

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:52.660
Or should I slap you in the face like I did the last time?

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:55.280
I was lonely.

00:21:55.280 --> 00:21:56.580
Rina-chan, I...

00:21:57.130 --> 00:21:59.800
No, it's almost time for me to perform.

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:02.030
Wait outside.

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:25.450
The savior goddess

00:22:23.770 --> 00:22:25.450
is hurt

00:22:25.980 --> 00:22:28.410
I'm the one

00:22:26.980 --> 00:22:28.410
who hurt her

00:22:35.470 --> 00:22:40.020
Why?

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:55.970
watashi ni itsumo anata wa yasashii

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:55.970
You have always been kind to me

00:22:56.900 --> 00:23:02.540
sono yasashisa ga fuan ni suru

00:22:56.900 --> 00:23:02.540
But this kindness makes me insecure

00:23:04.710 --> 00:23:11.380
unmei no ito hodokenai you ni

00:23:04.710 --> 00:23:11.380
This string of fate, I'll retie it over and over

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:17.990
nando mo musubi naoshite

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:17.990
So that it will never come loose

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:26.360
tsugi ni au yakusoku dekinai mama

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:26.360
I don't want to hear you say goodbye

00:23:27.660 --> 00:23:36.310
wakare no kotoba mada kikitaku wa nai yo

00:23:27.660 --> 00:23:36.310
Until we make promises to meet again

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:44.050
aenai yoru ni yume de aetara

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:44.050
Even if we can't meet tonight, 
if I can see you in my dreams

00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:51.960
ashita ga tsurakute mo waratte irareru

00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:51.960
Even if tomorrow is difficult I'll be able to smile

00:23:51.960 --> 00:23:59.430
donna ni tooku hanarete ite mo

00:23:51.960 --> 00:23:59.430
No matter how far apart we may become

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:09.410
tsunagatte ireru to shinjite iru

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:09.410
I believe that we will still be connected together

00:24:21.840 --> 00:24:23.570
Page 23

00:24:23.570 --> 00:24:25.730
Hoping to be nursed by her and eat her homecooked food,

00:24:25.730 --> 00:24:27.560
he wanted to catch a cold.

00:24:27.560 --> 00:24:30.590
The suffering that was to come never even occurred to him.

00:24:30.590 --> 00:24:31.710
White Album.
